  "final_message": "In accordance with **ARCH-4** (*\"`OrderPlaced` and `OrderCancelled` are consumed by services in other repositories: billing-service and analytics-ingest. No change may break a deployed consumer: changes are additive; renames and removals go through deprecation\"*), the field renames were implemented as additive changes with deprecation:\n\n1. **Introduced New Field Names**: Added `createdAt` and `amountCents` to [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L38) and populated them in [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73) to align with the Payments and Customer APIs.\n2. **Preserved Deprecated Fields**: Retained `placedAt` and `totalCents` with `@deprecated` JSDoc annotations and continue populating them so existing deployed consumers (`billing-service` and `analytics-ingest`) remain unbroken.\n3. **Tests**: Updated tests in [app.test.ts](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/test/app.test.ts) and [adapters.test.ts](file:///C:/avg/w2/r/test/adapters.test.ts) to verify both the new fields and backward compatibility.\n",
